Integration Test 1 — Preprocessing → Document Combination

Flow:

Raw input DataFrame
       ↓
preprocess_df()
       ↓
combine_documents()
       ↓
combined/clean dataset

This verifies that the output of preprocessing is actually compatible with the document-combination logic.

For example:

required columns survive preprocessing
documents are grouped correctly
multiple documents for the same entity are combined
dates/product/TA filtering doesn't break downstream processing

This is a good integration test because you're testing two real modules together.

